      "body": "**问题:**\r\n我想在子应用的挂载阶段和卸载阶段做一些事情，然后我加了mount、unmout处理。但是加了mount以后，页面第一次载入没问题，卸载完再进入就会报这个错? 我是react应用\r\n**如何复现**\r\n1、代码\r\n`\r\nlet rootAppInstance: any = null;\r\n\r\n// 检查是否在Wujie微前端环境中运行\r\nif ((window as any).__POWERED_BY_WUJIE__) {\r\n  // 定义微前端挂载逻辑\r\n  (window as any).__WUJIE_MOUNT = async () => {\r\n    console.log('Wujie ID:', window.__WUJIE.id);\r\n    console.log('挂载');\r\n    // 检查rootAppInstance是否已经初始化\r\n    if (!rootAppInstance) {\r\n      const rootElement = document.getElementById('root');\r\n      if (rootElement) {\r\n        rootAppInstance = ReactDOM.createRoot(rootElement);\r\n        console.log('应用实例创建成功');\r\n      } else {\r\n        console.error('未找到root元素');\r\n        return; \r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    rootAppInstance.render(<RootApp />);\r\n    console.log('应用挂载完成');\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  (window as any).__WUJIE_UNMOUNT = () => {\r\n    // 卸载React应用\r\n    if (rootAppInstance) {\r\n      rootAppInstance.unmount();\r\n      console.log('卸载完成');\r\n    } else {\r\n      console.log('没有可卸载的应用实例');\r\n    }\r\n    rootAppInstance = null;\r\n  };\r\n} else {\r\n  // 非Wujie环境下的挂载逻辑\r\n  const rootElement = document.getElementById('root');\r\n  if (rootElement) {\r\n    const root = ReactDOM.createRoot(rootElement);\r\n    root.render(<RootApp />);\r\n  } else {\r\n    console.error('未找到root元素');\r\n  }\r\n}`\r\n2、问题\r\n加上了(window as any).__WUJIE_MOUNT =（）=>{}， 就算什么也不写，再次挂载一定会报错\r\n\r\n**错误截图**\r\n![image](https://github.com/Tencent/wujie/assets/34928410/35de9cd2-07f6-4837-b668-6b4a51d27c1f)\r\n![image](https://github.com/Tencent/wujie/assets/34928410/e915fadf-884b-44be-8e32-5defbd3d6050)\r\n\r\n",
