      "body": "**描述bug**\r\n子应用下使用如下代码，输出结果不合预期。结果为undefined，预期结果为'test'字符串\r\n\r\n**如何复现**\r\n``` \r\n<script>\r\n    const object = {};\r\n    window.addAttributeToObject = function () {\r\n      this.a = \"test\";\r\n    };\r\n    window.addAttributeToObject.apply(object);\r\n    console.log(object.a); // undefined\r\n  </script>\r\n```\r\n\r\n**错误截图**\r\n-\r\n\r\n**最小复现仓库或者地址**\r\n-\r\n",
